In 2022, King Kong appears as a non-playable character alongside Godzilla in ''[[Call of Duty: Warzone (2020 video game)|Call of Duty: Warzone]]''. Once again as part of a crossover promotion with ''Godzilla vs. Kong'', the update is titled ''Operation Monarch''. A cosmetic outfit based on Kong is also released for both ''Warzone'' and ''[[Call of Duty: Vanguard]]''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.polygon.com/23035927/godzilla-vs-king-kong-call-of-duty-warzone-crossover|title=Call of Duty: Warzone getting Godzilla and King Kong crossover|date=April 21, 2022|publisher=Polygon|access-date=April 22, 2022|archive-date=April 21, 2022|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220421181853/https://www.polygon.com/23035927/godzilla-vs-king-kong-call-of-duty-warzone-crossover|url-status=live}}</ref> Also that year Kong appeared in the game [[World of Warships]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/video-games/3726344/godzilla-vs-kong-returns-to-world-of-warships-in-august-update/|title=Godzilla vs. Kong' returns to 'World of Warships' in August Update|date=August 8, 2022|publisher=Bloodydisgusting.com|access-date=December 22, 2023}}</ref> In 2024, Kong was also featured in ''[[Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III]]'' and ''[[Call of Duty: Warzone 2.0]]'' in an update called ''Godzilla x Kong: Battle for Hollow Earth'' to tie into the film ''[[Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire]]''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://gamerant.com/call-of-duty-godzilla-x-kong-finisher/|title=Call of Duty's New Godzilla x Kong Finisher Is Intense|date=March 7, 2024 |access-date=April 26, 2024}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.ign.com/videos/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-3-official-godzilla-x-kong-the-new-empire-bundles-trailer|title=Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 3 - Official Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire Bundles Trailer|date=March 28, 2024 |access-date=April 26, 2024}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.ign.com/articles/call-of-duty-players-say-new-king-kong-glove-that-costs-more-in-cod-points-than-the-game-itself-isnt-worth-buying|title=Call of Duty Players Say New King Kong Glove That Costs More in COD Points Than the Game Itself Isn't Worth Buying|date=April 9, 2024 |access-date=April 26, 2024}}</ref>

Also in 2022, King Kong appeared in the mobile game ''Kong Skull Island x Evony: The King's Return'' as a tie in to the film ''[[Kong Skull Island]]'' by Evony, LLC.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.tohokingdom.com/blog/godzilla-x-evony-the-kings-return/|title=Godzilla x Evony:The Kings Return|date=February 18, 2023 |access-date=February 22, 2023|archive-date=February 22, 2023|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230222181602/https://www.tohokingdom.com/blog/godzilla-x-evony-the-kings-return/|url-status=live}}</ref>

In 2023, [[Zen Studios]] released a three pack video game collection for [[Pinball FX (2023 video game)|Pinball FX]] called ''Godzilla vs. Kong: Pinball Pack'' which features three tables, ''Kong Pinball'', ''Godzilla Pinball'' and ''Godzilla vs. Kong Pinball''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://nerdist.com/article/godzilla-vs-kong-pinball-fx-zen-studios-legendary-entertainment/|title=GODZILLA VS. KONG Gets the Pinball FX Treatment for a Battle Royale|access-date=July 16, 2023}}</ref>

Also in 2023, GameMill Entertainment released ''[[Skull Island: Rise of Kong]]'' for all platforms.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/video-games/3769974/king-kong-returns-to-video-games-this-fall-with-the-action-adventure-title-skull-island-rise-of-kong-trailer/|title=King Kong Returns to Video Games With Action-Adventure Title ''Skull Island: Rise of Kong''|date=July 20, 2023 |access-date=July 23, 2023}}</ref>

In 2024 a trio of King Kong games were released. Hunted Cow Studios and [[Tilting Point]] released the mobile game ''Godzilla x Kong: Titan Chasers'',<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bleedingcool.com/games/godzilla-x-kong-titan-chasers-is-currently-taking-pre-registrations/|title=Godzilla x Kong: Titan Chasers Is Currently Taking Pre-Registrations|date=April 13, 2024 |access-date=April 24, 2024}}</ref> 7Levels released ''[[Kong: Survivor Instinct]]'' for the PC and consoles,<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.gamespot.com/articles/a-trio-of-monsterverse-games-are-coming-later-this-year-including-one-inside-roblox/1100-6525831/|title=A Trio Of Monsterverse Games Are Coming Later This Year, Including One Inside Roblox|access-date=August 17, 2024}}</ref> and Supersocial released ''Monsterverse Supersocial Roblox Experience'' for [[Roblox]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/video-games/3826128/legendary-announces-trio-of-upcoming-monsterverse-games/|title=Legendary Announces Trio of Upcoming Monsterverse Games|access-date=August 17, 2024}}</ref>

Also in 2024, a fully licensed electronic arcade whacking game machine called ''Godzilla vs. Kong Smasher'' was released by Unis Technology.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.replaymag.com/unis-previews-brand-new-godzilla-vs-kong-smasher/|title=UNIS Previews Brand-New Godzilla vs. Kong Smasher|date=November 6, 2023 |access-date=August 29, 2025}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.intergameonline.com/coin-op/news/unis-release-godzilla-vs-kong-smasher|title=Unis releases Godzilla vs. Kong Smasher|date=February 27, 2024 |access-date=August 29, 2025}}</ref>

